e_index_identity_can_mix_editor_history.md:40:- Tests cover deletion at every position, subsequent undo/redo, selection restoration, and external phrase changes.\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_002_data_management.md:10:internalId: 2e7fb122-602f-46fa-b976-5fb68c8d7680\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\B_060_action_editor_violates_component_style_guide.md:10:internalId: 20c3de42-e6c3-440f-b91d-adff2af2a63a\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\B_071_external_action_deletion_crashes_the_editor.md:10:internalId: 6be2c35b-ee4d-477f-8b1c-051ab999265c\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\B_061_action_editor_test_coverage_misses_failure_paths.md:10:internalId: c4eddafe-d799-4d1c-80fd-a01f5df3c8ea\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\B_061_action_editor_test_coverage_misses_failure_paths.md:26:- Phrase documents: stable identity, selection, and undo/redo history after add/delete/reorder and external reload.\ndesign\\feature_descriptions\\F_116_add_copy_path_and_relative_path_to_context_menu.md:4:internalId: 26fc69f5-78ff-4e8e-81a7-c458232db575\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_005_card_view.md:10:internalId: 6c90adc8-e294-4377-b9f9-7eabe2fc362b\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_005_card_view.md:17:Parsing now lives behind the shared `markdownParsingService` ([[F-021]]), whose `parseCard`/`splitCards` create `ProjectCard`s that `DataService` can save. `CardTypeConfig` already carries a per-type `color` (added with theming, [[F-018]]). `CardHeader` has `id`, `title`, `status`, `owner`, `affects` and `internalId`, but not parsed `after` ordering or `policy`. `ProjectWorkspace` still shows active cards as a flat `CardSelectButton` list with a plain `TextField` textarea editor — no columns, drag-and-drop, policy leds, type-color line, inline title editing, or body dialog/accordion. No drag-and-drop library is installed.\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_005_card_view.md:20:- Data model: parse `after` and `policy` in the shared parsing service, add them to `CardHeader`, and keep `internalId` as the stable identity referenced by `after`. Extend `CardTypeConfig` with a per-type color.\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_005_card_view.md:23:- Ordering: derive column order from `after`, where `after` stores the preceding card's `internalId`. Dragging within a column updates `after`; dragging between columns updates `status` and `after`. Use `@dnd-kit` (`@dnd-kit/core` + `@dnd-kit/sortable`, with `@dnd-kit/modifiers` as needed) for drag-and-drop — chosen for built-in touch/pointer support (desktop + mobile), a sortable model that fits cross-column moves, and its lightweight, TypeScript-native, accessible API. On drop, persist only the two/three cards whose `after` values changed.\ndesign\\feature_descriptions\\F_114_show_nr_of_changed_lines.md:4:internalId: 0ef8b9a6-ac40-4617-b077-17260b17a61c\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_006_text_view.md:10:internalId: a66239e5-a985-4ff4-bd9c-388c2b767aed\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\B_073_action_editor_has_overlapping_state_and_list_implementations.md:10:internalId: 857fa2f3-8e22-484c-8c81-a0828bae9c5e\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\B_073_action_editor_has_overlapping_state_and_list_implementations.md:48:- Every Markdown document keeps independent undo/redo history and flushes changes through its own save callback when switching documents.\ndesign\\feature_descriptions\\F_119_add_merge_conflict_resolver_support.md:2:internalId: 3373bf52-14c0-4cc7-8f7c-555c835af9a0\r\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\B_072_action_editor_ui_state_mutates_domain_actions.md:10:internalId: c0d8c3dd-3c19-404b-8994-b3526621d63e\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_004_app_layout.md:10:internalId: 21a12220-2d7a-4e6b-a775-a289a13c6188\ndesign\\feature_descriptions\\F_121_add_support_for_placeholders_in_the_action_input_box.md:4:internalId: 6ed58954-002c-45ea-87fe-4e6f0cae832d\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_007_markdown_editor.md:10:internalId: 55bf4053-034f-411d-9c02-a790eac475ce\ndesign\\feature_descriptions\\F_117_make_approval_box_floating.md:4:internalId: 9a0ff654-6397-4b5f-8ab5-f1679971e8cd\ndesign\\releases\\0_0_2\\F_010_actions